`,e.jsx(t.p,{children:"It mirrors the internal tooling AI labs build - trace viewers, agent debuggers, eval surfaces - and the load-bearing constraint is performance: a real run is tens of thousands of spans, and it has to stay at 60fps while you pan, zoom, and scrub."}),`
