`,e.jsx(t.p,{children:"Jotdown does for Apple Stickies what iTerm2 did for Terminal: it keeps the familiar shape and raises the ceiling. Notes are still small, borderless windows that float on the desktop, drag, resize, and color like Stickies. Inside each one, though, is a genuine markdown editor: headings, lists, quotes, dividers, links, and fenced code all render in place, and only the line under the cursor reveals its raw syntax."}),`
